# Per-hospital priced JSONs are served from R2 (HL_MRF_PARSED/prices/{ccn}.json)
# via the /api/prices/:ccn route. The Worker assets fallback is intentionally
# skipped — these files routinely exceed Cloudflare's 25 MiB per-asset limit
# (current largest: 020006.json at 85 MiB). Keep index.json which is the
# small registry the homepage + about-the-numbers build into the bundle.
data/prices/*.json
!data/prices/index.json
